  transaction locks. Preserve unchanged stale values, clearing and historical
  copy/import through guarded restore paths. Verify store atomic denial,
  reactivation and stale lifecycle; check forged native edits in Chromium.
- Documentation: Describe description PUT, strict types/clears/omitted values,
  atomic writes, emoji forwarding, native reopening and verification limits.
- Card description PUT: Support strings and empty/null clears, reject invalid
  types atomically and preserve omitted data. Keep Unicode/whitespace/HTML;
  fix escaped emoji loss in Gambas 3.20 transport. Verify permissions, archived
  no-op, SQL rollback/failed-COMMIT retry and native Chromium reopening.
- Documentation: Describe date PUT, UTC storage/native projection and remaining
  controls/parser gaps; record seven original callbacks, 44 helper cases,
  ten COMMIT phases and packaged Chromium date verification.
- Card dates: Add four UTC PUT fields, exact milliseconds, clears/invalid skips
  and atomic people/date writes. Preserve native day edits and lifecycle data;
  prevent numeric JSON precision loss. Verify 44 original-helper cases, #5846,
  source/archive HTTP and ten failed-COMMIT/retry phases. Full local-time parsing
  and native date/time controls remain pending.
- Documentation: Describe people PUT replacement/coercion/duplicates, native
  interactions, legacy responses, partial support, eight COMMIT phases and
  six-of-thirty original callback coverage.
- People PUT: Add replacement/clear/coercion with active filtering and exact
  ordered duplicates; preserve explicit JSON keys, legacy reads and unique
