  every occurrence on pull/self-unassignment and group native member rows.
  Verify original #3697, source/archive negatives, partial/failed-COMMIT rollback
  and packaged Chromium PUT/native interaction; other card fields remain open.
- Documentation: Describe native card-member controls, permissions, active/stale
  choices, popups, native/REST COMMIT tests and 105 imported interface keys.
